  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Under Heavenly Court pressure, Lang Ya Sect activates the Long Hair refinement path formation to refine Myriad Self Immortal Gu for Fang Yuan after he joins Lang Ya Sect. He watches rather than personally refining inside that formation, leaving the work to Lang Ya land spirit and the hairy man Gu Immortals. The recipe he deduced spends no Immortal Gu, only large amounts of immortal materials and mortal Gu, which raises material cost and labor enough that the Long Hair formation is needed. After two months of Lang Ya blessed land time the refinement reaches its final step and a rank seven Immortal Gu appears. It is more than ten meters long, like a centipede with a metallic luster, a dangerous looking mouthpiece and a pair of long antennas on its head, and five thousand legs on either side for ten thousand in total. It succeeds on the first attempt, at a fifty percent success rate. It starts ownerless because he did not refine it himself, then he refines it rapidly with the formation’s help.",
        "chapters": [
          1570
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
